+// One completed network exchange, observed through ResourceLoadComplete.
+//
+// Chromium's WebContentsObserver surface reports resource loads when they
+// finish, not when they start, so a record always describes a completed
+// exchange and carries both request and response fields. Request-shaped waits
+// resolve from the same records; they are not dispatch-time notifications.
